{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0044_1000_040tam", "source_sha256": "0e63345f38248ab36d8bebdb1a70ddca8e6ef94cf5a649afc11d411e5c9b4af1", "ja": "おやぶん、おやぶん！\nたまき達のチーム、優勝したぞ～！　見てた！？", "zh": "老大老大！\n环我们的车队第一名喔～！你有看到吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0044_1001_p", "source_sha256": "14ec55b9acc6c5e038ce38efa5572cb4deb6e77d34181266245b0e4bdcf126b5", "ja": "ああ、ちゃんと見てたぞ。\n環、よくやったな！", "zh": "嗯，我都看到了。\n环，你表现得很好呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0044_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "ef7e04922887da0a0935c74023747168f9a09d124a2a71c4740a616556eceefe", "ja": "うん！　たまき、いーっぱい応援したから、\nめちゃくちゃ嬉しいぞ～！", "zh": "嗯！因为环很～努力地帮忙加油，\n所以超高兴的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0044_1003_p", "source_sha256": "21d642e6bf7843eed0eb8998d0eb4755b72288671eb59180cc48d7ff1d01c90f", "ja": "この後は、いよいよライブだけど……\n環、疲れてないか？", "zh": "等一下就是演唱会了……\n环，你会不会累？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0044_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "940919276f7103e95cd9455cc3122fcbdbc06601d94f78ffdbdfa84f6b8fa1d6", "ja": "たまき、へっちゃらだよ！\nレッドチームのみんなもね、ライブ楽しみだって♪", "zh": "环没问题的！\n红队的大家也说很期待演唱会喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0044_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "df8caace9916dec1db0eace0ab7f3f30a7bfd13ea12a94508c2737d1ed4634a9", "ja": "おやぶん、レースクイーンのお仕事楽しかった！\nたまき、またやりたい！", "zh": "老大，赛车女郎的工作好开心喔！\n环下次还想再来当！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0044_1006_p", "source_sha256": "69a411c1bace44f51a2c4e14b08f5f04d66d1b44a4e5c3893b1bb3dfb3cb7a32", "ja": "そうか。お客さん達にも、チームの人達にも\n好評みたいだし……またできるかもな！", "zh": "这样啊。观众们和车队成员的评价\n似乎也很不错……可能还有机会再来呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0044_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "9add8a8d9bff1bf60ccfa025bc805765a84198f544b85547c221f66690b6d2b5", "ja": "そうなの？　みんな、たまきのこと、ほめてた？\nくふふ。たまき、てれちゃうぞ……♪", "zh": "是吗？大家有夸奖环吗？\n呵呵。环会害羞啦……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0044_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9d811854c4895eaf558939e37db6938b41fe11c931184c0a03b109f79a1188e5", "ja": "おっと、そろそろスタンバイの時間だな。\n環、いけるか？", "zh": "哎呀，差不多该去准备了。\n环，你可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0044_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "084e2d0c35caef48c818820f40fbd50be4fb8fe09067d8fb8e0dfc257a4c66ed", "ja": "うん！　オッケーだよ、おやぶん！\nライブ、がんばってくるね！", "zh": "嗯！OK的，老大！\n环会在演唱会上好好努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0044_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "a4e59ed52f02316f459500bc0bcae94094fdb874ecabe2ad3a42ce6f181aa317", "ja": "あとね、帰る前にたまき、もう1回車見たい！\nあと、ぴ……ピットも！", "zh": "还有啊，回去之前，环想再看一次车子！\n还有维……维修站！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0044_1011_p", "source_sha256": "fd9f18e20e616f228ea80043797ecdc8445ea90af48623456ec6a8d1fcd801dd", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\n見学させてもらえるよう、頼んでおくよ。", "zh": "嗯，好啊。\n我会去拜托对方让你参观的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0044_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "1a8b48fa21bf5cecbeb318ebd38e8bd8cf77fbd96aba1b3dbeefa94aa2cb4cac", "ja": "ホント！？\nありがとー、おやぶん！", "zh": "真的吗！？\n谢谢你～老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0044_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "1db9c0774fa07ea5fce3953dac0113f87d3659b2db54d3f3c24a4994b66b4e1e", "ja": "くふふ……たまき、こっそり、\n運転のしかた教えてもらっちゃおっと！", "zh": "呵呵……环要去偷偷请教\n开车的技巧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
